  <DOCID>begona</DOCID>
  <TIMEX3 tid="t0" type="DATE" value="2014-12-31T00:00:00" functionInDocument="CREATION_TIME" temporalFunction="false">2014-12-31</TIMEX3>
  <TEXT>HEMATOLOGIA&#13;
<EVENT eid="e1" class="OCCURRENCE">OSPITALERATZEKO</EVENT> ARRAZOIA.&#13;
<EVENT eid="e2" class="OCCURRENCE">Sukarra</EVENT> duen 60 urteko emakumea.&#13;
<TIMEX3 tid="t1" type="DATE" value="PRESENT_REF" temporalFunction="true">EGUNGO</TIMEX3> <EVENT eid="e3" class="OCCURRENCE">GAIXOTASUNA</EVENT>.&#13;
<TIMEX3 tid="t2" type="DURATION" value="PT12H" temporalFunction="false">Duela 12 ordu</TIMEX3> <EVENT eid="e4" class="OCCURRENCE">ondoeza</EVENT> <EVENT eid="e5" class="REPORTING">nabaritzen</EVENT> <EVENT eid="e6" class="ASPECTUAL">hasi</EVENT> da.&#13;
Berehala <EVENT eid="e7" class="OCCURRENCE">sukarra</EVENT> eta <EVENT eid="e8" class="OCCURRENCE">dardarak</EVENT> izan ditu, antitermikoekin guztiz <EVENT eid="e9" class="OCCURRENCE">hobetu</EVENT> ez direnak, eta horregatik <EVENT eid="e10" class="OCCURRENCE">etorri</EVENT> da Larrialdietako Zerbitzura.&#13;
<EVENT eid="e11" class="REPORTING">Dioenez</EVENT>, ez du <EVENT eid="e12" class="OCCURRENCE">eztulik</EVENT>, <EVENT eid="e13" class="OCCURRENCE">karkaxarik</EVENT>, <EVENT eid="e14" class="OCCURRENCE">arnasesturik</EVENT>, bularreko <EVENT eid="e15" class="OCCURRENCE">minik</EVENT>, <EVENT eid="e16" class="OCCURRENCE">gorakorik</EVENT>, <EVENT eid="e17" class="OCCURRENCE">beherakorik</EVENT> edo sabeleko <EVENT eid="e18" class="OCCURRENCE">minik</EVENT> izan.&#13;
AURREKARIAK.&#13;
Ez dauka farmakoekiko <EVENT eid="e19" class="OCCURRENCE">alergia</EVENT> ezagunik.&#13;
Ez du <EVENT eid="e20" class="OCCURRENCE">hipertentsiorik</EVENT>, <EVENT eid="e21" class="STATE">diabetesik</EVENT> edo <EVENT eid="e22" class="OCCURRENCE">dislipemiarik</EVENT>.&#13;
<EVENT eid="e23" class="OCCURRENCE">Erretzailea</EVENT> <TIMEX3 tid="t3" type="DURATION" value="P2Y" temporalFunction="false">duela bi urte</TIMEX3> arte. &#13;
<TIMEX3 tid="t4" type="DATE" value="2011-08" temporalFunction="false">2011ko abuztuan</TIMEX3> mantuko zelulen <EVENT eid="e24" class="OCCURRENCE">linfoma</EVENT> <EVENT eid="e25" class="OCCURRENCE">diagnostikatu</EVENT> zioten IV-B estadioan (<EVENT eid="e26" class="OCCURRENCE">adenopatiez</EVENT> gain, hezur-muinaren <EVENT eid="e27" class="OCCURRENCE">infiltrazioa</EVENT> zuen).&#13;
<TIMEX3 tid="t5" type="DURATION" value="P1M" temporalFunction="false">Azken hilabetean</TIMEX3> <TIMEX3 tid="t6" type="SET" value="P1D" temporalFunction="true">gaueko</TIMEX3> <EVENT eid="e28" class="OCCURRENCE">izerdia</EVENT> eta <EVENT eid="e29" class="OCCURRENCE">sukarra</EVENT> izan ditu.&#13;
<EVENT eid="e30" class="OCCURRENCE">Markatzaile</EVENT> immunologikoei dagokienez, <EVENT eid="e31" class="OCCURRENCE">CD19</EVENT> (+), <EVENT eid="e32" class="OCCURRENCE">CD20</EVENT> (+), <EVENT eid="e33" class="OCCURRENCE">CD22</EVENT> (+), <EVENT eid="e34" class="OCCURRENCE">CD5</EVENT> (+), <EVENT eid="e35" class="OCCURRENCE">CD23</EVENT> (-), <EVENT eid="e36" class="OCCURRENCE">CD79a</EVENT> (+), <EVENT eid="e37" class="OCCURRENCE">CD43</EVENT> (+), eta D1 ziklina nuklearraren <EVENT eid="e38" class="OCCURRENCE">adierazpena</EVENT> biziki positiboa.&#13;
Kimioterapiako <EVENT eid="e39" class="OCCURRENCE">tratamenduan</EVENT> <EVENT eid="e40" class="ASPECTUAL">hasi</EVENT> zen eta lau <EVENT eid="e41" class="OCCURRENCE">ziklo</EVENT> Rituximab-CHOP hartu ditu <TIMEX3 tid="t7" type="DURATION" value="P1M" temporalFunction="false">denbora horretan</TIMEX3> (<EVENT eid="e42" class="OCCURRENCE">azkena</EVENT> <TIMEX3 tid="t8" type="DURATION" value="P1W" temporalFunction="false">duela astebete</TIMEX3>).&#13;
Bigarren <EVENT eid="e43" class="OCCURRENCE">zikloaren</EVENT> ondoren egindako PET-OTA <EVENT eid="e44" class="OCCURRENCE">proban</EVENT> <EVENT eid="e45" class="OCCURRENCE">erantzun</EVENT> metaboliko osoa <EVENT eid="e46" class="REPORTING">berretsi</EVENT> zen.&#13;
<EVENT eid="e47" class="OCCURRENCE">Tratamendua</EVENT>: <EVENT eid="e48" class="OCCURRENCE">omeprazola</EVENT>, <EVENT eid="e49" class="OCCURRENCE">alopurinola</EVENT>, <EVENT eid="e50" class="OCCURRENCE">ziprofloxazinoa</EVENT> eta <EVENT eid="e51" class="OCCURRENCE">flukonazola</EVENT>.&#13;
<EVENT eid="e52" class="OCCURRENCE">MIAKETA</EVENT> FISIKOA.&#13;
<EVENT eid="e53" class="OCCURRENCE">Tenperatura</EVENT>, 38,8 °C; <EVENT eid="e54" class="OCCURRENCE">tentsio</EVENT> arteriala, 80/40; <EVENT eid="e55" class="OCCURRENCE">bihotz-maiztasuna</EVENT>, 110 tau/min; arnas <EVENT eid="e56" class="OCCURRENCE">maiztasuna</EVENT>, 24 arnas/min, <EVENT eid="e57" class="OCCURRENCE">O2Sat</EVENT> basala,% 93.&#13;
<EVENT eid="e58" class="OCCURRENCE">Kontziente</EVENT>, partzialki <EVENT eid="e59" class="OCCURRENCE">orientatua</EVENT>.&#13;
<EVENT eid="e60" class="OCCURRENCE">Kakektiko</EVENT>.&#13;
Ahoko <EVENT eid="e61" class="OCCURRENCE">lehortasuna</EVENT>.&#13;
Mukosa eta larruazalen <EVENT eid="e62" class="OCCURRENCE">kolorazio</EVENT> normala.&#13;
Burua eta lepoa.&#13;
Ez du jugularren <EVENT eid="e63" class="OCCURRENCE">ingurgitaziorik</EVENT>, ez <EVENT eid="e64" class="OCCURRENCE">adenopatia</EVENT> ukigarririk, ez <EVENT eid="e65" class="OCCURRENCE">zeinu</EVENT> meningeorik ere.&#13;
Bihotzaren <EVENT eid="e66" class="OCCURRENCE">auskultazioa</EVENT>: <EVENT eid="e67" class="OCCURRENCE">erritmikoa</EVENT> eta <EVENT eid="e68" class="OCCURRENCE">murmuriorik</EVENT> gabea; biriken <EVENT eid="e69" class="OCCURRENCE">auskultazioa</EVENT>: <EVENT eid="e70" class="OCCURRENCE">aireztapen</EVENT> normala.&#13;
Sabelaldea.&#13;
<EVENT eid="e71" class="OCCURRENCE">Biguna</EVENT>, <EVENT eid="e72" class="OCCURRENCE">beheragarria</EVENT>.&#13;
<EVENT eid="e73" class="REPORTING">Haztapenean</EVENT> ez du <EVENT eid="e74" class="OCCURRENCE">minik</EVENT>, ez eta <EVENT eid="e75" class="OCCURRENCE">masa</EVENT> edo <EVENT eid="e76" class="OCCURRENCE">megaliarik</EVENT> ere.&#13;
<EVENT eid="e77" class="OCCURRENCE">Heste-soinu</EVENT> normalak.&#13;
Gorputz-adarrak.&#13;
Ez <EVENT eid="e78" class="OCCURRENCE">edemarik</EVENT>, ez eta bena sakonetako <EVENT eid="e79" class="OCCURRENCE">tronbosi-zeinurik</EVENT> ere.&#13;
<EVENT eid="e80" class="OCCURRENCE">PROBA</EVENT> OSAGARRIAK.&#13;
<EVENT eid="e81" class="OCCURRENCE">ELEKTROKARDIOGRAMA</EVENT>.&#13;
<EVENT eid="e82" class="OCCURRENCE">Erritmo</EVENT> sinusala, 95 tau/min.&#13;
TORAXEKO <EVENT eid="e83" class="OCCURRENCE">ERRADIOGRAFIA</EVENT> <EVENT eid="e84" class="OCCURRENCE">asaldurik</EVENT> gabea.&#13;
<EVENT eid="e85" class="OCCURRENCE">ANALITIKA</EVENT>.&#13;
<EVENT eid="e86" class="OCCURRENCE">Biokimika</EVENT>: <EVENT eid="e87" class="OCCURRENCE">kreatinina</EVENT>, 1,03 mg/dl; <EVENT eid="e88" class="OCCURRENCE">urea</EVENT>, 43 mg/dl; <EVENT eid="e89" class="OCCURRENCE">Cl</EVENT> (<EVENT eid="e90" class="OCCURRENCE">kloroa</EVENT>), 103 meq/l; <EVENT eid="e91" class="OCCURRENCE">Na</EVENT> (<EVENT eid="e92" class="OCCURRENCE">sodioa</EVENT>), 139 meq/l; <EVENT eid="e93" class="OCCURRENCE">K</EVENT> (bitamina), 4,3 meq/l; <EVENT eid="e94" class="OCCURRENCE">gluzemia</EVENT>, 164 mg/dl; <EVENT eid="e95" class="OCCURRENCE">prokaltzitonina</EVENT>, 21; <EVENT eid="e96" class="OCCURRENCE">proteina</EVENT> C-erreaktiboa 97.&#13;
<EVENT eid="e97" class="OCCURRENCE">HEMOGRAMA</EVENT>.&#13;
<EVENT eid="e98" class="OCCURRENCE">Hemoglobina</EVENT>, 9,7 g/dl; <EVENT eid="e99" class="OCCURRENCE">hematokritoa</EVENT>,% 29,1; <EVENT eid="e100" class="OCCURRENCE">plaketak</EVENT> 70.000/ï­ l;; <EVENT eid="e101" class="OCCURRENCE">leukozitoak</EVENT>, 580/ï­ l;; <EVENT eid="e102" class="OCCURRENCE">neutrofiloak</EVENT>, 80/ï­ l;.&#13;
GERNUAREN <EVENT eid="e103" class="OCCURRENCE">KULTIBOA</EVENT>.&#13;
<EVENT eid="e104" class="OCCURRENCE">E</EVENT>. colirentzat positiboa.&#13;
<EVENT eid="e105" class="OCCURRENCE">ANTIBIOGRAMA</EVENT>.&#13;
<EVENT eid="e106" class="OCCURRENCE">Ziprofloxazino</EVENT> eta <EVENT eid="e107" class="OCCURRENCE">amoxizilinarekiko</EVENT> sentikorra.&#13;
<EVENT eid="e108" class="OCCURRENCE">ODOL-KULTIBOA</EVENT>.&#13;
<EVENT eid="e109" class="OCCURRENCE">E</EVENT>. colirentzat positiboa.&#13;
<EVENT eid="e110" class="OCCURRENCE">Antibiograma</EVENT>: <EVENT eid="e111" class="OCCURRENCE">ziprofloxazino</EVENT> eta <EVENT eid="e112" class="OCCURRENCE">amoxizilinarekiko</EVENT> sentikorra.&#13;
<EVENT eid="e113" class="OCCURRENCE">EBOLUZIOA</EVENT>.&#13;
Ospitalean <EVENT eid="e114" class="OCCURRENCE">sartu</EVENT> eta berehala, <EVENT eid="e115" class="OCCURRENCE">kultiboak</EVENT> egin ondoren, arrisku baxuko <EVENT eid="e116" class="STATE">neutropeniarako</EVENT> protokoloan oinarritutako <EVENT eid="e117" class="OCCURRENCE">tratamendu</EVENT> antibiotikoarekin <EVENT eid="e118" class="ASPECTUAL">hasi</EVENT> ginen.&#13;
Horrez gain, <EVENT eid="e119" class="OCCURRENCE">hidratazio</EVENT> egokia eta konstanteen <EVENT eid="e120" class="OCCURRENCE">jarraipen</EVENT> hertsia mantendu genuen <TIMEX3 tid="t9" type="DURATION" value="PTXH" temporalFunction="true">lehenengo orduetan</TIMEX3>.&#13;
Hala ere, pazientearen <EVENT eid="e121" class="OCCURRENCE">tentsioak</EVENT> baxu <EVENT eid="e122" class="ASPECTUAL">jarraitzen</EVENT> zuen, eta <EVENT eid="e123" class="OCCURRENCE">diuresia</EVENT> oso eskasa izan zen <TIMEX3 tid="t10" type="DURATION" value="PTXH" temporalFunction="true">lehenengo orduetan</TIMEX3>.&#13;
Hori zela-eta, <EVENT eid="e124" class="OCCURRENCE">droga</EVENT> basoaktiboak behar izan zituen <TIMEX3 tid="t11" type="DURATION" value="P2DT12H" temporalFunction="false">2-3 egunean</TIMEX3>.&#13;
<EVENT eid="e125" class="OCCURRENCE">Egoera</EVENT> hemodinamikoa <EVENT eid="e126" class="OCCURRENCE">egonkortu</EVENT> ondoren, droga basoaktiboak <EVENT eid="e127" class="OCCURRENCE">kendu</EVENT>, eta <EVENT eid="e128" class="OCCURRENCE">tratamendu</EVENT> antibiotikoa mantendu genuen <TIMEX3 tid="t12" type="DURATION" value="P10D" temporalFunction="false">10 egunean</TIMEX3>.&#13;
<EVENT eid="e129" class="OCCURRENCE">Eboluzio</EVENT> kliniko egokia izan du, <EVENT eid="e130" class="OCCURRENCE">sukarra</EVENT> <TIMEX3 tid="t13" type="DURATION" value="PT24H" temporalFunction="false">24 ordu</TIMEX3> <EVENT eid="e131" class="OCCURRENCE">igaro</EVENT> ondoren <EVENT eid="e132" class="OCCURRENCE">desagertu</EVENT> zen.&#13;
<EVENT eid="e133" class="OCCURRENCE">DIAGNOSTIKOA</EVENT>.&#13;
<EVENT eid="e134" class="OCCURRENCE">KIMIOTERAPIA</EVENT> BIDEZKO <EVENT eid="e135" class="OCCURRENCE">TRATAMENDUAN</EVENT> DAGOEN MANTUKO ZELULEN <EVENT eid="e136" class="OCCURRENCE">LINFOMA</EVENT>.&#13;
IV. GRADUKO <EVENT eid="e137" class="OCCURRENCE">NEUTROPENIA</EVENT>.&#13;
GERNU-APARATUKO <EVENT eid="e138" class="OCCURRENCE">INFEKZIOA</EVENT>.&#13;
<EVENT eid="e139" class="OCCURRENCE">SHOCK</EVENT> SEPTIKOA.&#13;
<EVENT eid="e140" class="OCCURRENCE">TRATAMENDUA</EVENT> ETA BESTE <EVENT eid="e141" class="OCCURRENCE">GOMENDIO</EVENT> BATZUK.&#13;
<EVENT eid="e142" class="OCCURRENCE">Atsedena</EVENT> <EVENT eid="e143" class="OCCURRENCE">gomendatzen</EVENT> zaizu.&#13;
<EVENT eid="e144" class="OCCURRENCE">Dieta</EVENT> arrunta.&#13;
<TIMEX3 tid="t14" type="DATE" value="PRESENT_REF" temporalFunction="true">Orain</TIMEX3> arte hartzen ari zen <EVENT eid="e145" class="OCCURRENCE">tratamenduarekin</EVENT> <EVENT eid="e146" class="ASPECTUAL">jarraitu</EVENT> behar du.&#13;
<EVENT eid="e147" class="OCCURRENCE">Sukarra</EVENT> edo <EVENT eid="e148" class="OCCURRENCE">ondoeza</EVENT> berriro agertuz gero, Larrialdietako Zerbitzura <EVENT eid="e149" class="OCCURRENCE">etorri</EVENT>.&#13;
LABORATEGIKO PROBEN EMAITZEI BURUZKO TXOSTENA&#13;
LAGINA:&#13;
Lagina hartzeko data:&#13;
Lagin-zk.:&#13;
Lagin-mota (testua + kodea), Zehaztapen-taldea, <EVENT eid="e150" class="OCCURRENCE">Biokimika</EVENT> orokorra, <EVENT eid="e151" class="OCCURRENCE">Gernu-lagin</EVENT> sistematikoak, <EVENT eid="e152" class="OCCURRENCE">Hormonak</EVENT>, <EVENT eid="e153" class="OCCURRENCE">Tumore-markatzaileak</EVENT>, Medikamentu eta toxikoen <EVENT eid="e154" class="OCCURRENCE">mailak</EVENT>, <EVENT eid="e155" class="OCCURRENCE">Gasometria</EVENT>, <EVENT eid="e156" class="OCCURRENCE">Hematologia</EVENT>, <EVENT eid="e157" class="OCCURRENCE">Hemostasia</EVENT> (<EVENT eid="e158" class="OCCURRENCE">koagulazioa</EVENT>), <EVENT eid="e159" class="OCCURRENCE">Hemoterapia</EVENT>, Hematologia- <EVENT eid="e160" class="OCCURRENCE">Koagulazioa</EVENT> (<EVENT eid="e161" class="OCCURRENCE">proba</EVENT> bereziak), <EVENT eid="e162" class="OCCURRENCE">Immunologia</EVENT>- <EVENT eid="e163" class="OCCURRENCE">Alergia</EVENT>, <EVENT eid="e164" class="OCCURRENCE">Mikrobiologia</EVENT>, <EVENT eid="e165" class="OCCURRENCE">Genetika</EVENT>, <EVENT eid="e166" class="OCCURRENCE">Anatomia</EVENT> patologikoa- <EVENT eid="e167" class="OCCURRENCE">Biopsiak</EVENT>, <EVENT eid="e168" class="OCCURRENCE">Anatomia</EVENT> patologikoa- <EVENT eid="e169" class="OCCURRENCE">Zitologiak</EVENT>.&#13;
